  "source_pdf": "downloads/iron-fans-ribbon-parade-v1-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "fd33c10fa446b8d86cea053b91b95eff37b4155fa6b53c9dd84511f7ca827f32",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2f1aac7b055ee86a679f7b4ed131a5a9d963684150a0ff2bf1e2ffc1bdd950f8",
      "text": "铁扇公主的彩带游行",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "523f4b28f8e2b0e99ac3545a27e921db495b6a5966bf6d62c5abcf3453d0b826",
      "text": "铁扇公主有个好主意：\n“我们来办彩带游行吧！\n每人一条彩带。”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "994b484ad16f60b14693ebc19ff9ea934a9085d1c2f29a4fbe009221fbba832c",
      "text": "玉兔拿了黄彩带，\n铁扇公主拿了紫彩带，\n悟空拿到红彩带——\n它卷成了小小一团。\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a72df8291d5fcfa82190983c7e95c1dc744368facca90cfdab8d4bf00cba4954",
      "text": "悟空皱起眉头：\n“我的最短！”\n铁扇公主说：“我们再看看。”\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5d3503e6e7679da9660b17e0b04361bee26de1031cb6ab768f17d96c791ecac",
      "text": "悟空拉呀拉呀，\n哇！\n红彩带长长地拖了出来。\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "924aacadaf49b8b6f8fb227ffc5ada0e381aaba080830cfc71056cb69d2fd6f3",
      "text": "大家把彩带摊在地上。\n悟空把红彩带往前一挪：\n“现在我的最长！”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1f6c35fe6cf26a8a0b8ec04adf3717b2aba6e21db70bb81e2fb1979a208d800f",
      "text": "玉兔咯咯笑：\n“你的彩带从那么前面开始！\n这样可不算数。”\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "261546e79040a0ab6d98c6f0af94201f1bacee4f5443bd9d6fd8c1ccf1a361a8",
      "text": "铁扇公主轻轻点了点石板边：\n“大家从同一条线开始。”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "89a8827d8f497bb9217aeff638ea53f02133927e569fbaf4428dffe5fe5edea7",
      "text": "黄彩带和紫彩带从同一条\n线开始。\n“紫彩带长一些，\n黄彩带短一些。”\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cdee9bd8f28da56f4225d44562c60a0759fa98e4e56470643f47fd235c5861d4",
      "text": "红彩带也从这条线开始。\n“红彩带比紫彩带还长！”\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a3195346aadbffafcda5ab3c3be62c8c098f37187ba194028ac591ec16db8c46",
      "text": "玉兔一条一条地指：\n“短的，长一些的，最长的！”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "502c2a5cb62e3af38c6c058402def9ab45e3dc27b0346f735f3ec28c07e67b9d",
      "text": "悟空欢呼：\n“我的最长！\n这回是真的！”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d0ff3b8a0b1b8f17b817ba0691f0d3c2d807c39c6e11c9e5a62aadcf523ffe0c",
      "text": "游行开始啦！\n玉兔转着短短的彩带，\n铁扇公主把彩带举得高高的。\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8485c132efec531c19404c53acd93f3137b343ec169d340219737fd8cdd27ae7",
      "text": "悟空跑起来，\n长长的红彩带飘在身后。\n“看！我有两条尾巴啦！”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "53b7c7d0d1d130538bc2992c243bce17b5177f8e71aaeda2000c62e0dedb8608",
      "text": "哎呀！彩带把悟空缠住了。\n铁扇公主打开扇子，\n轻轻扇一下——呼！\n彩带松开，飘了起来。\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8fb1e6dcce94520d20857bba8a3bd032cc9914bc965658eb12efa8e800ab6f70",
      "text": "游行结束了，\n他们又把彩带排在同一条线上：\n短的，长一些的，最长的。\n“真是一场好游行！”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
